  "solution": {
    "text": "The net result of oxidation is the cleavage of the bond between C's with the attached O's with addition of OH to 'C' of each <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> .<br /><br />In 1, 2-diols, the net effect is the oxidation is the cleavage of <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/655073.PNG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 79px; height: 62px;\" />&nbsp;bond and attachment of an OH to each 'C' atom. The gem-diol so formed loses a molecule of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> .<br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mtext>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mtext></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mtext>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mtext></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><munder><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mtext>&nbsp;&nbsp;</mtext></mrow></munder></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></munder><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"nor